#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:424
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> provides two types of frequencies "
"tables:"
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har två typer av frekvenstabeller:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:428
msgid ""
"The frequency table tools is primarily useful for non-numeric data (data of "
"nominal and ordinal level of measurement). It allows to determine "
"frequencies for given values."
msgstr ""
"Verktygen för frekvenstabeller passar främst för icke-numeriska data, där "
"värdena anger kategorier eller en ordning. De används för att beräkna hur "
"ofta angivna värden förekommer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:432
msgid ""
"The histogram tool is useful for numeric data that is supposed to be "
"classified into a certain number of intervals. These intervals can be either"
" specified or calculated."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget Histogram passar för numeriska data som ska delas in i ett visst "
"antal intervall. Intervallen kan anges i förväg eller beräknas av verktyget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:439
msgid "Frequency Tables Tool"
msgstr "Verktyg för frekvenstabeller"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:444
msgid ""
"The frequency tool can be used to create frequency tables for non-numerical "
"data. It presents this table numerically as well as graphically."
msgstr ""
"Frekvensverktyget kan skapa frekvenstabeller för icke-numeriska data. "
"Tabellen visas både numeriskt och grafiskt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:449
msgid ""
"If your data are numeric and you want to accumulate whole intervals of "
"values into frequency counts then this tool is not appropriate. In that case"
" you may want to use the histogram table tool described in section <xref "
"linkend=\"histogram-tool\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Om dina data är numeriska och du vill samla värden i intervall och räkna "
"förekomster passar det här verktyget inte. Använd i så fall verktyget "
"Histogram som beskrivs i avsnittet <xref linkend=\"histogram-tool\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:456
msgid "Frequency Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för frekvensverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:458
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the dialog "
"to generate various frequency tables open to the \"Input\" tab.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av dialogrutan för"
" att skapa frekvenstabeller, med fliken Indata öppen.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:471
msgid ""
"As shown in <xref linkend=\"frequency-tool-dialog\"/>, the frequency table "
"dialog has four tabs. We will introduce them in sequence."
msgstr ""
"Som visas i <xref linkend=\"frequency-tool-dialog\"/> har dialogrutan "
"Frekvensverktyg fyra flikar. De presenteras i tur och ordning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:478 C/gnumeric.xml:630 C/gnumeric.xml:2126
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Input</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Indata</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:480
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Input</guilabel></quote> tab shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"frequency-tool-dialog\"/> contains the field specifying the data "
"to be used for the histogram."
msgstr ""
"Fliken <quote><guilabel>Indata</guilabel></quote> i <xref "
"linkend=\"frequency-tool-dialog\"/> innehåller fältet där du anger vilka "
"data som ska användas i histogrammet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:484 C/gnumeric.xml:636
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Input Range</guilabel></quote> entry contains a single "
"range or a list of ranges, that can be grouped into variables by rows, "
"columns, or areas."
msgstr ""
"Fältet <quote><guilabel>Indataområde</guilabel></quote> innehåller ett "
"cellområde eller en lista med cellområden. Områdena kan delas in i variabler"
" efter rader, kolumner eller delområden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:489 C/gnumeric.xml:641
msgid ""
"If the first row or column of the given input ranges, or the first field of "
"each area contains labels, the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> "
"option should be selected. If the input is grouped by areas and the top left"
" cell contains a label, the other cells in the first row are being ignored."
msgstr ""
"Om den första raden eller kolumnen i de angivna cellområdena, eller det "
"första fältet i varje delområde, innehåller rubriker väljer du alternativet "
"<quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote>. Om indata grupperas i "
"områden och cellen längst upp till vänster innehåller en rubrik ignoreras de"
" övriga cellerna på den första raden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:499
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Categories</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Kategorier</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:501
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Categories</guilabel></quote> tab permits the "
"specification of a range that contains the possible values that are supposed"
" to be counted in the input range."
msgstr ""
"På fliken <quote><guilabel>Kategorier</guilabel></quote> kan du ange ett "
"cellområde med de värden som ska räknas i indataområdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:506
msgid ""
"The <quote><guilabel>Automatic categories</guilabel></quote> option is "
"disabled since it is not yet implemented."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guilabel>Automatiska kategorier</guilabel></quote> är "
"inaktiverat eftersom funktionen ännu inte har implementerats."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:511
msgid "Frequency Tool Dialog Categories Tab"
msgstr "Fliken Kategorier i dialogrutan för frekvensverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:513
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency-"
"cats.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the dialog to generate various frequency tables open to the \"Categories\" "
"tab.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-frequency-"
"cats.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"dialogrutan för att skapa frekvenstabeller, med fliken Kategorier "
"öppen.</phrase> </textobject>"
